' 2026-10-22: dev.40 の実コードを確認して作成。
' 既存の設計図は保持。本ファイルは現在の主要クラスの抜粋。
' PortはJavaScriptの構造契約。明示的なinterface宣言ではない。
' 直近の検証記録: 2026-10-18、328テスト成功。この作図時には再実行していない。

' 1ファイルにつき1図。PlantUML 1.2026.9で描画を検証。

@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Meiryo
title 戦旗水滸伝 dev.40 — 戦闘データの責務と継承
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty members

class Stage {
  turn
  phase
  unitOrder
  +validateRuntime()
}
class Unit {
  troops
  facing
  actionState
  statusEffects
  remainingUses
}
class Character {
  name
  martial
  command
  intelligence
  charisma
}
class BattleMap {
  +getPosition(unit)
  +moveUnit(unit, position)
}
class MapCell
class Position
class Terrain
class ArmyManager
class Army
class BattleLog
class HiddenTrap
class UnitControlRule
class StageAIConfig
class DialogueManager
class Dialogue
class Speech
class StageEventManager
class StageEvent
class ReinforcementEvent
class BetrayalEvent
class MissionTransitionEvent
class DialogueEvent
class ObjectiveManager
class Objective
class EliminationObjective
class ReachObjective
class UnitDefeatObjective
class TurnLimitObjective
class SurviveUntilTurnObjective

Stage *-- "1" BattleMap
Stage *-- "1" ArmyManager
Stage *-- "0..*" Unit
Stage *-- "1" BattleLog
Stage *-- "0..*" HiddenTrap
Stage *-- "0..*" UnitControlRule
Stage *-- "1" StageAIConfig
Stage *-- "1" DialogueManager
Stage *-- "1" StageEventManager
Stage *-- "1" ObjectiveManager

Unit --> "1" Character : 不変の人物能力
BattleMap *-- "1..*" MapCell
MapCell --> "1" Position
MapCell --> "1" Terrain
MapCell --> "0..1" Unit : 占有
ArmyManager *-- "2" Army : 味方軍・敵軍
Army --> "0..*" Unit : 所属
DialogueManager --> "0..*" Dialogue
Dialogue --> "1..*" Speech
Speech --> "0..1" Character : 話者

StageEventManager *-- "0..*" StageEvent
StageEvent <|-- ReinforcementEvent
StageEvent <|-- BetrayalEvent
StageEvent <|-- MissionTransitionEvent
StageEvent <|-- DialogueEvent
ObjectiveManager *-- "0..*" Objective
Objective <|-- EliminationObjective
Objective <|-- ReachObjective
Objective <|-- UnitDefeatObjective
Objective <|-- TurnLimitObjective
Objective <|-- SurviveUntilTurnObjective

note right of Unit
  部隊の兵力・向き・行動状態を保持。
  座標と所属は保持しない。
end note
note bottom of BattleMap
  位置・占有の唯一の正本。
end note
note bottom of ArmyManager
  所属の唯一の正本。
  寝返り時にも重複所属を防止。
end note
note bottom of Character
  現在の人物能力は固定V9基準。
  Excel第4.7版との照合済みではない。
end note
@enduml
